  "description": "Therany is a stylish rounded serif font that blends timeless elegance with a soft, contemporary personality. Designed with smooth curves, refined serifs, and beautifully crafted ligatures, this typeface delivers a warm yet sophisticated appearance that stands out across modern branding projects. Its balanced proportions and graceful letterforms create a luxurious visual rhythm, making every word feel polished and memorable.\nPerfect for fashion brands, beauty products, premium packaging, editorial layouts, wedding stationery, logo design, and high-end marketing materials, Therany offers exceptional versatility. The rounded serif construction provides excellent readability while maintaining a distinctive designer aesthetic that captures attention in both print and digital environments.\nTherany can use luxury brand identity, magazine headline, social media campaign, or elegant website typography, Therany brings a unique combination of softness, class, and professionalism. The stylish ligatures and premium details help designers achieve a refined, upscale look with minimal effort, making it an essential font for modern creative projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Therany is a stylish rounded serif font that blends timeless elegance with a soft, contemporary personality. Designed with smooth curves, refined serifs, and beautifully crafted ligatures, this typeface delivers a warm yet sophisticated appearance that stands out across modern branding projects. Its balanced proportions and graceful letterforms create a luxurious visual rhythm, making every word feel polished and memorable.</p>\n<p>Perfect for fashion brands, beauty products, premium packaging, editorial layouts, wedding stationery, logo design, and high-end marketing materials, Therany offers exceptional versatility. The rounded serif construction provides excellent readability while maintaining a distinctive designer aesthetic that captures attention in both print and digital environments.</p>\n<p>Therany can use luxury brand identity, magazine headline, social media campaign, or elegant website typography, Therany brings a unique combination of softness, class, and professionalism. The stylish ligatures and premium details help designers achieve a refined, upscale look with minimal effort, making it an essential font for modern creative projects.</p>",
